	<section_number>45.2-747</section_number>
	<catch_line> Conveyor crossings</catch_line>
	<text>
		Suitable facilities for crossing a conveyor belt shall be provided where it is necessary for miners to cross such conveyor belt regularly.
	</text>
	<history>Code 1950, § 45-69.5; 1954, c. 191; 1966, c. 594, § 45.1-71; 1994, c. 28, § 45.1-161.136; 2021, Sp. Sess. I, c. 387.</history>
